n- python3 analyze.py selfcheck\n- independent reconstruction of packet.json from frozen inputs → prove byte-identity against the frozen packet (expected sha c9598052)\n- prove planned cardinality exactly 48 rows / 24 pairs / 8 per stratum\n- prove all 48 outgoing payloads match the frozen packet\n- tamper controls against the key scientific invariants: pair swap, decisive-fact drop, question leak, polarity flip, resend-on-resume\n\n## Step 3 — freeze verified BEFORE and AFTER the checks\nAny drift between the two verifications fails the gate.\n\n## Step 4 — credential scan\nGrep all experiment7 artifacts + the three scripts for secret patterns; prove only the named locations (env var name TYPESAFE_API_KEY, --credential-file path) appear, never values.\n\n## Deliverables (commit ONLY these 3 paths on #574)\n1. research/jev-bounded-judgment/phase2/experiment7/freeze.py\n2. research/jev-bounded-judgment/phase2/experiment7/FREEZE.json\n3. research/jev-bounded-judgment/phase2/experiment7/PHASE-A.md\n\nPHASE-A.md carries per-gate PASS/FAIL, component count, freeze version, and an explicit measured-calls-equals-0 statement.\n\n## Constraints honoured\nNothing under experiment6/, no frozen packet, no builder/runner/scorer source, and no other file is modified. The only subcommand that can spend is run_noul.py run — it is never invoked.\n\n## Certainty\nPlan is evidence-based: I read DESIGN.md §§F/G/I and the CLI surfaces of build_packet.py, run_noul.py, analyze.py. NOT-TESTED until execution: whether the pipeline passes its own gates.","created_at":"2026-09-29T15:01:59.681580114Z","kind":"note","signed_by":"SHA256:ysA8Ntd7onMFCreK2Fnm+JnK5KF1TUsnch/A0ci1z9c","signature":"U1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg4CkeeC+dK2ZKqbQVkOTqjJAvPQ+WlStOdsrcoGbpoL0AAAARY3Jvc3NsaW5rLWNvbW1lbnQAAAAAAAAABnNoYTUxMgAAAFMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAABAzwFC6AennuVbsnnoDrjNXsfQMpSexvsX0236Ej76lsccRpmHI5Iy+GU7DxlL5S5tJjP6Mqx6U43pxwWjDvsWCg=="},"signed_by":"SHA256:ysA8Ntd7onMFCreK2Fnm+JnK5KF1TUsn